Why?
The lineage creation request requires a reason.

We selected:

Reason: Other
Comment: CitiML XPath parent-child relationship POC

Reason ID:
33c1090f-9861-41cf-b43b-d51bfecf0d0b


8. STEP 4 – CREATE RELATIONSHIPS

API: Configuration API

Method: POST

Resource:
/isg/internal/data-highway/config-api/v1/attributes-symlinks/create

We created two relationships:

TradeNotification
        ↓
NotificationBundleDetails
        ↓
Events

Important request fields:

attributesFrom      : Parent attribute
attributesTo        : Child attribute
relation.type       : LINEAGE
relation.cardinality: ANY
transformationLogic : DIRECT
lineageReason       : Other
owner               : Approved SOEID

Initially, we received an error because
transformationLogic was missing.

After adding DIRECT transformation logic,
both relationships were created successfully.

We used LINEAGE to represent the XML hierarchy.
No actual transaction data was transferred.


